:: Thomas Hang Out End Late Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you are walking around trying to figure out what to do next, you spy that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> is following you with a low energy posture, even more so than usual, and a very unamused expression. <span style="color:LightCoral">It is pretty clear he hasn’t enjoyed himself.</span> As you stop to try and think of what to do next, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> interrupts you.<br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Thomas",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Eyes: "Tired",
            },
