    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Look, this has been… a time. But I gotta get going. Some of us don’t have all the free time in the world and have jobs to get to. So, you can keep doing… whatever, but I’m heading off.”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> turns without even giving you a chance to respond, not even saying goodbye when you try to say farewell. Seems the boy is a bit upset you wasted his time.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Thomas" -3>>
